    "detailed_description": "Defeat the most powerful deities in the Greek pantheon, child of Zeus, and take your rightful place on Mt Olympus. Learn to shatter the sky with lightning and shower the earth with fire. Summon heroes to aid your people and plagues to destroy the enemy. Play the second great \u201cgod game\u201d from the minds behind Black &amp; White, and prove you have what it takes to stand among the divine. <br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Use dozens of godly powers.</strong> Populous 2 bestows even more amazing powers upon you, giving you control of earth, wind, water, wind, flora, and \u2014 most importantly \u2014 people. Protect your crucial settlements with ghastly swamps, create deadly whirlwinds, or grow a beautiful forest around the enemy base\u2026before setting it on fire.<br></li><li><strong>Summon the heroes of old.</strong> Odysseus, Herakles, Perseus, and more are yours to command, each with their own special ability. Bless them with your favor, and use their strengths well to win the day. <br></li><li><strong>Conquer a massive world.</strong> With 1,000 maps to conquer, you\u2019re going to have every opportunity to put your skills to the test. Best your enemy on every map (or skip a few when you secure a decisive victory) with the promise of true godhood waiting at the end.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Defeat the most powerful deities in the Greek pantheon, child of Zeus, and take your rightful place on Mt Olympus. Learn to shatter the sky with lightning and shower the earth with fire. Summon heroes to aid your people and plagues to destroy the enemy. Play the second great \u201cgod game\u201d from the minds behind Black &amp; White, and prove you have what it takes to stand among the divine. <br><br><strong>Key features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Use dozens of godly powers.</strong> Populous 2 bestows even more amazing powers upon you, giving you control of earth, wind, water, wind, flora, and \u2014 most importantly \u2014 people. Protect your crucial settlements with ghastly swamps, create deadly whirlwinds, or grow a beautiful forest around the enemy base\u2026before setting it on fire.<br></li><li><strong>Summon the heroes of old.</strong> Odysseus, Herakles, Perseus, and more are yours to command, each with their own special ability. Bless them with your favor, and use their strengths well to win the day. <br></li><li><strong>Conquer a massive world.</strong> With 1,000 maps to conquer, you\u2019re going to have every opportunity to put your skills to the test. Best your enemy on every map (or skip a few when you secure a decisive victory) with the promise of true godhood waiting at the end.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Become the god you were born to be.",
